 "summary": "The simplicial relative shuffle map, relative cross product, `prodPreimageFstIso`, `isSplitMono_\u03b9TensorObj` and `quasiIso_shuffle` have no existing counterpart in Mathlib or TauCeti; the only analogue is the cubical `cubicalCrossProduct` (`Singular/Cubical/Comparison/Relative/Kunneth.lean`), on a different chain model, which this PR mirrors. Existing API (`shortExact_tensorRightShortComplex`, `HomologySequence.quasiIso_\u03c4\u2083`, `HomotopyEquiv.quasiIso_inv`, `isSplitMono_homologyKunneth`, `tmul_ne_zero`, `fiberLocalization`) is reused rather than re-derived.",
